## Executive Indicators

Overall Program Health • Cost Variance • Schedule Variance • Milestone Completion • Overdue Milestones • Open Risk Exposure • Critical Issues • Corrective-Action Completion • 30/60/90-Day Deadlines • Data-Quality Exceptions

## Why This Solution Fits the Challenge

From an architectural standpoint, the objective is not simply to combine datasets. The solution establishes relationships between operational records so that a program-health indicator can be traced back to the milestone, risk, issue, cost condition, or corrective action that caused it. Therefore, leadership receives both the signal and the underlying explanation.

## Remote Delivery Capability

Data modeling, Power BI development, Power Platform configuration, requirements analysis, program-health logic, documentation, testing, stakeholder reviews, and executive reporting are highly compatible with remote delivery when authorized environments are accessible.

